.TH RIFT 1
.SH NAME
rift, vi \- edit text with the Rift editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rift
.RI [ file ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rift is the native text editor for FUZIX and Fuse-X.
The vi command is a symbolic link to Rift.
It supports multiple buffers, syntax highlighting, searching, and a file picker.
.PP
The editor starts in normal mode.
Press i to insert text and Escape to return to normal mode.
Use :w to save, :q to quit, :wq to save and quit, or :q! to discard changes.
.PP
F1 opens help and F10 opens the menu.
.SH SEE ALSO
levee(1), ed(1)
